---
---
<section class="section-starting-points" id="starting-points">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sp-header">
      <span class="weroast-badge-pill" style="margin-bottom: 1rem; border-color: rgba(105, 83, 138, 0.2);">
        You don't have to have everything ready.
      </span>
      <h2 class="sp-title">You don't need a complete website concept yet.</h2>
      <p class="sp-desc">
        Maybe you're starting from scratch. Maybe you already have a logo, a domain, or your first materials. Or maybe you want to replace a temporary website with a well-thought-out solution.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="sp-asymmetric-grid">
      <!-- Large Featured Card -->
      <div class="sp-card card-large">
        <div class="sp-card-icon icon-yellow">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="sp-card-title">Start from scratch</h3>
        <p class="sp-card-text">
          We build the content base, visual identity and technical foundation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Stacked Small Cards -->
      <div class="sp-card-stack">
        <div class="sp-card card-small card-blue">
          <div class="sp-card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <line x1="3" y1="9" x2="21" y2="9"></line>
              <line x1="9" y1="21" x2="9" y2="9"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="sp-card-title">There are the first elements</h3>
            <p class="sp-card-text">
              Verificăm ce poate fi utilizat și ce trebuie completat sau îmbunătățit.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sp-card card-small card-green">
          <div class="sp-card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M21 2v6h-6"></path>
              <path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 15-6.7L21 8"></path>
              <path d="M3 22v-6h6"></path>
              <path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-15 6.7L3 16"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="sp-card-title">Înlocuiți o soluție provizorie</h3>
            <p class="sp-card-text">
              Clarificăm ce s-a dovedit util și ce trebuie să ofere mai bine noua prezență.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sp-footer-note">
      <p>
        Punctul de pornire este compania dumneavoastră: ce oferiți, cui vă adresați, ce trebuie să înțeleagă potențialii clienți și care este următorul pas dorit?
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-starting-points {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: #ffffff;
  }
  .sp-header {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  .sp-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--brand-navy);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .sp-desc {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .sp-asymmetric-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .sp-card {
    background: var(--bg-page);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }
  .sp-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }
  .sp-card-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .icon-yellow { background: var(--accent-yellow-dark); color: #ca8a04; }
  
  .sp-card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .sp-card-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .card-large {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #fafafa;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .sp-card-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .card-small {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  .card-small .sp-card-icon {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .card-blue {
    background: #f0f9ff;
    border: 1px solid #bae6fd;
  }
  .card-blue .sp-card-icon { background: #e0f2fe; color: #0284c7; }
  
  .card-green {
    background: #f0fdf4;
    border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
  }
  .card-green .sp-card-icon { background: #dcfce3; color: #16a34a; }

  .sp-footer-note {
    background: var(--brand-navy-dark);
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 27, 48, 0.15);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .sp-asymmetric-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .card-small {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
